# Mock Product Images Guide

## Alternative: Placeholder Services (Recommended)

Since direct product images may have licensing/restriction concerns, use these automated placeholder services:

### 1. Lorem Picsum (Random photos)
```
https://picsum.photos/300/400?random=1
https://picsum.photos/300/400?random=2
```

### 2. Placehold.co (Solid colors with text)
```
https://placehold.co/300x400/FF6B6B/FFFFFF?text=Vape
https://placehold.co/300x400/4ECDC4/FFFFFF?text=Candy
https://placehold.co/300x400/95E1D3/FFFFFF?text=Drink
```

### 3. DummyImage.com
```
https://dummyimage.com/300x400/3498db/ffffff&text=Product
```

